WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:49.640 --> 01:51.370
Geez, what is it now?

01:59.980 --> 02:02.420
It's undergone massive revisions!

02:02.420 --> 02:05.750
You can plunge into
an atmosphere as it is now!

02:05.750 --> 02:06.750
Gee...

02:06.750 --> 02:10.890
The Paksis continues to surprise me.

02:10.890 --> 02:13.220
Anyway, isn't something beeping?

02:15.430 --> 02:16.900
What's going on now?

02:16.900 --> 02:19.970
Apparently, there's a crack on the ship!

02:19.970 --> 02:21.940
What was that?

02:21.940 --> 02:24.340
We have trouble in Area 36.

02:24.340 --> 02:27.540
Security crew, please confirm immediately.

02:29.240 --> 02:30.980
This is fun!

02:30.980 --> 02:33.210
A great flood!

02:33.210 --> 02:34.720
Check it on camera...

02:34.720 --> 02:37.550
- That brat...
- Check it thoroughly!

02:41.190 --> 02:43.920
What the hell is going on?

02:45.860 --> 02:47.800
My pillow...

02:47.800 --> 02:50.420
I can't sleep without it!

02:51.500 --> 02:53.160
Pai-check!

02:56.040 --> 02:58.470
I found a boiled octopus, ribbit!

03:00.380 --> 03:04.400
It's worst for humans
to chill their bottom half.

03:08.780 --> 03:11.720
How are things right now?

03:11.720 --> 03:13.390
Everything looks all right...

03:13.390 --> 03:18.360
...except the fact that the
men's rooms have been flooded.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.690
A flood...

03:19.690 --> 03:20.860
I'll drown.

03:20.860 --> 03:23.870
I'm going to evacuate with Pyoro-2.

03:23.870 --> 03:25.130
Hold on, Pyoro!

03:25.130 --> 03:27.170
Don't treat Kahlua like a toy!

03:27.170 --> 03:28.830
She's Pyoro-2.

03:33.840 --> 03:36.940
It looks like we
can't use this for a while.

03:42.480 --> 03:43.590
There you are!

03:43.590 --> 03:45.050
No place to sleep, right?

03:45.050 --> 03:46.750
Why not come to my room?

03:46.750 --> 03:49.260
Oh, thanks!

03:49.260 --> 03:53.630
I was worried about sleeping
with a different pillow.

03:53.630 --> 03:55.060
Not you!

03:55.060 --> 03:57.230
Come on! Come!

03:57.230 --> 04:00.440
I-I'm always telling
you to not mess with me!

04:00.440 --> 04:04.970
Geez... I won't let something
like this be a chance to pity me!

04:04.970 --> 04:07.980
A samurai may not eat but can hold out!

04:07.980 --> 04:09.480
A toothpick.

04:09.480 --> 04:12.010
- Geez...
- Then I'll take his place.

04:12.010 --> 04:16.020
I'm saying that I have no
need for you, lightbulb-head!

04:16.020 --> 04:18.120
L-Lightbulb?

04:18.120 --> 04:21.360
Come on, wait for me, Hibiki!

04:21.360 --> 04:23.520
Energetic as usual, isn't she?

04:23.520 --> 04:25.430
Sorry to trouble you.

04:25.430 --> 04:26.660
That's my line.

04:26.660 --> 04:28.630
Sorry, I'll fix it right away.

04:28.630 --> 04:31.000
Want to come to my room until then?

04:31.000 --> 04:34.000
No, I'll just appreciate your sentiments.

04:34.000 --> 04:37.310
I feel most at ease here.

04:37.310 --> 04:38.470
I see...

04:38.470 --> 04:40.130
This place, huh?

04:43.040 --> 04:44.050
Geez...

04:44.050 --> 04:45.440
Each and every one.

04:46.650 --> 04:49.280
I came here on the spur of the moment...

04:49.280 --> 04:53.020
I guess this is the best place for me.

04:54.320 --> 04:55.980
But still...

04:57.090 --> 04:59.530
Partner!

04:59.530 --> 05:02.120
You've changed quite a bit.

05:03.970 --> 05:06.300
What's that smell?

05:06.300 --> 05:08.940
I thought you'd be here!

05:08.940 --> 05:11.270
Here, this'll warm you up.

05:19.010 --> 05:21.180
W-What are you looking at?

05:21.180 --> 05:22.920
I thought you were cute.

05:22.920 --> 05:24.150
I-Idiot.

05:24.150 --> 05:26.420
Don't tell a guy he's cute.

05:26.420 --> 05:28.620
But you are cute!

05:28.620 --> 05:30.190
Oh, something's stuck here.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.730
Stop it. Don't touch me.

05:31.730 --> 05:33.860
You don't have to be so shy!

05:33.860 --> 05:35.190
I'm not being shy!

05:36.230 --> 05:38.530
You really are cute!

05:38.530 --> 05:41.090
Do you listen to others?

05:42.670 --> 05:44.540
And?

05:44.540 --> 05:48.340
So you simply turned back around?

05:48.340 --> 05:50.310
But...

05:50.310 --> 05:52.950
Geez. How pathetic.

05:52.950 --> 05:56.080
Dita, what were you expecting, ribbit?

05:56.080 --> 05:57.650
N-Nothing, really.

05:57.650 --> 06:02.390
I just wanted to give some
porridge to Mr. Alien, so...

06:02.390 --> 06:06.590
Oh, right! I have to
check those two, ribbit!

06:06.590 --> 06:08.230
What are you doing?

06:08.230 --> 06:11.570
Found someone with a cold!
I'll lock her up immediately!

06:11.570 --> 06:14.090
Someone with a cold?

06:15.270 --> 06:16.800
Let me go, ribbit!

06:16.800 --> 06:18.040
Absolutely not!

06:18.040 --> 06:20.640
It'd be a problem if
you gave Pyoro-2 the cold!

06:20.640 --> 06:25.050
You'll be in there for life
unless you shake that cold.

06:25.050 --> 06:27.450
No way, I can't check like this!

06:29.220 --> 06:30.450
Amaro, how is it?

06:30.450 --> 06:31.550
Here they come!

06:31.550 --> 06:32.520
Let's see...

06:32.520 --> 06:35.280
Geez, he looks so smitten.

06:36.460 --> 06:38.630
Come on, let's not watch this.

06:38.630 --> 06:39.660
You're kidding!

06:39.660 --> 06:43.730
It looks like Misty knows
everything about men.

06:43.730 --> 06:46.430
I want to see their
conversation, don't you?

06:46.430 --> 06:47.570
But...

06:47.570 --> 06:49.370
Come on, it's okay.

06:49.370 --> 06:50.510
Oh, there.

06:50.510 --> 06:52.130
She just touched his hand.

06:53.810 --> 06:56.640
What is this guy?
He's like an animal!

06:56.640 --> 06:59.010
But they sure are in a good mood.

07:01.750 --> 07:03.150
Delicious!

07:03.150 --> 07:04.890
What's this called?

07:04.890 --> 07:06.220
That's paella.

07:06.220 --> 07:10.120
They say there are as many
flavors as there are couples!

07:10.120 --> 07:11.290
What was that?

07:11.290 --> 07:15.320
It's a dish that you make
especially for your boyfriend.

07:16.700 --> 07:18.770
Who cares? This is great!

07:18.770 --> 07:20.500
- Gimme more!
- Geez...

07:20.500 --> 07:22.300
Hibiki, you eat so much!

07:22.300 --> 07:24.770
She said "boyfriend."

07:24.770 --> 07:26.740
- What's that?
- What's that?

07:31.880 --> 07:35.780
That pescatore was good,
but this is the best!

07:35.780 --> 07:36.850
Of course...

07:36.850 --> 07:40.020
Look! I also have tandoori chicken!

07:40.020 --> 07:41.460
Gimme!

07:41.460 --> 07:45.320
Oh, tough, so tough, tough.
This is tough...

07:47.860 --> 07:50.630
Geez, Hibiki I can understand.

07:50.630 --> 07:54.330
But even Duero is
kissing up to the women.

07:57.870 --> 07:59.440
What is that?

07:59.440 --> 08:01.710
Looks gross...

08:01.710 --> 08:03.210
Looks gross?

08:03.210 --> 08:04.870
I do?

08:07.880 --> 08:08.920
What are you doing?

08:08.920 --> 08:10.020
Vice-captain!

08:10.020 --> 08:13.420
I have nowhere to go.

08:13.420 --> 08:18.090
Can I stay in your room until
all the repairs are done?

08:19.230 --> 08:21.430
Sorry, that's impossible.

08:21.430 --> 08:25.100
How about staying in the navigation seat?

08:25.100 --> 08:26.100
Wait!

08:26.100 --> 08:27.300
You're kidding!

08:27.300 --> 08:31.210
That's too cold-hearted, Vice-captain...

08:31.210 --> 08:34.580
Look, she fed him with a spoon!
She fed him!

08:34.580 --> 08:37.110
That woman really is something.

08:37.110 --> 08:41.420
She's from a planet where men
and women live together, right?

08:41.420 --> 08:45.320
Even 150 Mejalians
are no match for her.

08:50.730 --> 08:52.390
Dita...

08:59.170 --> 09:02.440
You know, I can treat you to desserts

09:02.440 --> 09:07.070
that are even more
yummy and sweet in my room.

09:07.070 --> 09:08.740
S-Sweet?

09:20.590 --> 09:23.120
He's coming to my room right now.

09:23.120 --> 09:26.890
I thought of spending
sweet time alone with him.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.360
Let's go, Hibiki.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.020
S-Sure.

09:39.270 --> 09:43.340
Come on, Dita, what'll you do?

09:43.340 --> 09:45.510
Mr. Alien...

09:45.510 --> 09:47.420
U-Um...

09:47.420 --> 09:48.970
W-What is it?

09:50.990 --> 09:52.990
Come on, let's go, Hibiki!

09:52.990 --> 09:54.520
U-Um...

09:54.520 --> 09:58.960
Here, I didn't want you to be bored, so...

09:58.960 --> 10:00.060
This is no good.

10:00.060 --> 10:03.260
You can't fill a stomach with toys.

10:11.810 --> 10:16.210
I-I'm sorry, but men aren't
happy with things like that.

10:16.210 --> 10:18.740
I don't want you to get in our way!

10:22.850 --> 10:25.590
What's with her?

10:25.590 --> 10:27.780
Well, let's go, Hibiki!

10:31.690 --> 10:32.760
Come on, hurry!

10:32.760 --> 10:35.060
You can't!

10:35.060 --> 10:37.470
- I don't want you to go!
- Hurry!

10:37.470 --> 10:38.870
You can't!

10:38.870 --> 10:42.840
Let go, idiots! That hurts!

10:42.840 --> 10:44.470
- Mr. Alien!
- Hibiki!

10:44.470 --> 10:46.640
I've had enough of both of you!

10:46.640 --> 10:47.840
Geez...

10:47.840 --> 10:50.570
I'm not your toy, you know!

10:52.810 --> 10:54.610
You're always in my way!

10:56.850 --> 10:58.790
Misty's still in the lead.

10:58.790 --> 11:01.760
Dita's really weak right when it counts.

11:13.700 --> 11:16.240
Why...

11:16.240 --> 11:19.640
Why are so many tears coming out?

11:24.450 --> 11:26.650
Someone let me out, ribbit!

11:26.650 --> 11:29.010
Let me check on people!

11:39.360 --> 11:41.990
I'm buck naked in here...

11:43.960 --> 11:46.070
Hey!

11:46.070 --> 11:48.370
When will the repairs be done?

11:48.370 --> 11:50.810
Sorry, just a little bit longer.

11:50.810 --> 11:54.080
If you want to return soon,
why not help out?

11:54.080 --> 11:56.310
Plumbing is out of my league!

11:56.310 --> 11:57.310
Geez...

11:57.310 --> 12:00.750
If this doesn't get resolved,
I'll keep getting chased.

12:00.750 --> 12:03.620
That's not a problem
concerning your room, right?

12:03.620 --> 12:07.720
Nothing will be solved just
because you return here.

12:07.720 --> 12:09.460
Am I right?

12:09.460 --> 12:12.290
What do you want to say?

12:12.290 --> 12:15.900
We were taught growing up
that men were our enemies.

12:15.900 --> 12:19.030
But now we help each other

12:19.030 --> 12:23.070
and the feeling that we
can live together is forming.

12:23.070 --> 12:25.070
Furthermore...

12:25.070 --> 12:27.140
Between you and Dita...

12:27.140 --> 12:30.440
There's a feeling beyond that growing.

12:30.440 --> 12:33.510
I think you realize that yourself.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.980
W-What do you want me to do?

12:35.980 --> 12:38.220
We've never faced this before.

12:38.220 --> 12:42.920
But Hibiki Tokai
won't choose to run away.

12:42.920 --> 12:45.590
Right?

12:45.590 --> 12:47.860
Be honest with yourself.

12:47.860 --> 12:51.090
That's the only solution for this.

12:55.270 --> 12:57.970
She's starting to
talk more and more lately.

13:00.440 --> 13:02.840
Nothing has changed yet.

13:02.840 --> 13:05.150
Hey, what do you think will happen?

13:05.150 --> 13:08.010
Will a man and a woman
pair up, after all?

13:10.820 --> 13:11.820
Geez...

13:11.820 --> 13:13.910
I hate just watching.

13:23.300 --> 13:26.290
You were just thinking about Dita, right?

13:29.970 --> 13:31.470
You again?

13:31.470 --> 13:34.070
Geez, don't you have anything else to do?

13:34.070 --> 13:36.440
I don't.

13:36.440 --> 13:40.880
I'm an outsider, so there's
nowhere to go on this ship.

13:42.920 --> 13:45.920
My family on Pluto are all gone, too.

13:45.920 --> 13:47.720
I'm...

13:47.720 --> 13:50.190
...all alone.

13:50.190 --> 13:51.850
So...

13:57.930 --> 14:02.500
I-If you're bored, polish up there!

14:02.500 --> 14:04.160
Sure!

14:06.210 --> 14:12.280
Come to think, Misty's
been all alone, hasn't she?

14:12.280 --> 14:15.270
How about you become her friend, Dita?

14:18.190 --> 14:22.360
Hibiki, despite appearances,
is kind, so I'm sure he saw that

14:22.360 --> 14:25.890
and is playing with
Misty because of that.

14:25.890 --> 14:27.160
Ezra!

14:27.160 --> 14:29.430
I told you paper diapers were bad!

14:29.430 --> 14:31.570
It'll take longer to potty train her!

14:31.570 --> 14:33.630
Along with weaning off milk!

14:33.630 --> 14:37.260
- Oh, now she's drooling.
- I'm sorry, Pyoro.

14:45.210 --> 14:48.150
What's that sulky look on your face for?

14:51.090 --> 14:52.720
Want something?

14:52.720 --> 14:55.480
N-No, not really.

14:57.390 --> 15:00.660
Y-You know...

15:00.660 --> 15:02.860
I can't play cards...

15:02.860 --> 15:05.270
but I can at least listen to you.

15:05.270 --> 15:06.530
So...

15:06.530 --> 15:10.500
If you're fine with it, talk to me.

15:10.500 --> 15:13.210
Sorry to make you worry so much.

15:13.210 --> 15:15.310
That's not true.

15:15.310 --> 15:17.510
I know! I'll go make some tea.

15:17.510 --> 15:19.170
Sure...

15:37.600 --> 15:39.190
I'll do my best!

15:41.970 --> 15:43.630
Found you!

15:45.870 --> 15:47.600
You waited, right?

15:50.440 --> 15:52.510
Be honest.

15:52.510 --> 15:54.480
We're, you know...

15:54.480 --> 15:57.550
in a way, living together
in the same system.

15:57.550 --> 16:00.920
Hibiki, I'm so happy!

16:00.920 --> 16:03.820
Hey, what are you
doing all of a sudden?

16:03.820 --> 16:05.490
Mr. Alie...

16:12.770 --> 16:15.040
I-It's not...

16:15.040 --> 16:17.270
Looks like it got interesting again!

16:17.270 --> 16:19.330
- Dita's in trouble!
- A total battlefield!

16:24.880 --> 16:27.750
- Dita loses again!
- What's with her?

16:27.750 --> 16:29.450
But I feel sorry for her...

16:29.450 --> 16:31.120
Sheesh!

16:31.120 --> 16:35.090
I can't watch anymore!
She just has to be honest already!

16:35.090 --> 16:36.750
Time for a lesson.

16:38.030 --> 16:41.030
Hey, wait, this isn't what you think!

16:41.030 --> 16:42.200
No!

16:42.200 --> 16:44.660
Don't look at Dita, look at me!

16:46.500 --> 16:47.900
She's...

16:48.900 --> 16:50.540
She's...

16:50.540 --> 16:53.100
something that's never
happened to me before.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.740
I see...

17:13.330 --> 17:14.700
Dita!

17:14.700 --> 17:15.760
A mission.

17:15.760 --> 17:18.170
We'll be discussing a new formation

17:18.170 --> 17:20.230
so head to the meeting room right now.

17:20.230 --> 17:22.400
Got that?

17:22.400 --> 17:24.570
Got it!

17:24.570 --> 17:26.070
What?

17:26.070 --> 17:27.900
Camera standby, okay!

17:29.380 --> 17:30.340
What's starting?

17:30.340 --> 17:32.910
A live broadcast.

17:32.910 --> 17:34.570
Sorry I'm late...

17:39.320 --> 17:40.450
What is it?

17:40.450 --> 17:41.520
Both of you!

17:41.520 --> 17:44.960
I set it up so you're alone. Be grateful!

17:44.960 --> 17:45.960
Jura?

17:45.960 --> 17:47.290
Talk things out.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.300
The lock won't open until then.

17:49.300 --> 17:52.630
Don't make so much trouble for me, geez!

17:56.340 --> 17:58.330
You're giving me wrinkles!

18:01.810 --> 18:04.040
This is worth watching.

18:07.980 --> 18:10.280
They're so irritating!

18:10.280 --> 18:13.350
How long are you two
going to stay that way?

18:13.350 --> 18:15.190
Hurry up and talk!

18:15.190 --> 18:16.760
Shut up!

18:16.760 --> 18:19.690
You guys are annoying, sheesh...

18:19.690 --> 18:21.900
Mr. Alien...

18:21.900 --> 18:23.400
Geez...

18:23.400 --> 18:26.230
Oh, they irritate me!

18:26.230 --> 18:28.540
So that's what's going on!

18:28.540 --> 18:32.870
Here we have 150 people
all cheering for one girl.

18:32.870 --> 18:36.080
Mejale's pirates really
value friendship, huh?

18:36.080 --> 18:38.880
It's getting good,
so don't get in the way.

18:38.880 --> 18:40.150
You're kidding!

18:40.150 --> 18:43.250
I'm not so dumb I'd make
enemies of the whole ship.

18:43.250 --> 18:48.380
I was just fooling around
with him because I was bored.

19:09.180 --> 19:10.840
Misty.

19:13.480 --> 19:16.850
W-What? If it's a lecture,
I won't hear it!

19:16.850 --> 19:19.050
No need to put up a strong front.

19:19.050 --> 19:22.220
And you're never all by yourself.

19:22.220 --> 19:26.630
We're allies in the
fight against the Harvest.

19:26.630 --> 19:28.290
Right?

19:31.130 --> 19:32.790
Sister!

19:41.480 --> 19:43.780
U-Um...

19:43.780 --> 19:46.080
T-The water pipes...

19:46.080 --> 19:48.680
I hope they get repaired soon.

19:48.680 --> 19:50.050
Y-Yeah...

19:50.050 --> 19:53.220
This is no time for repairs.

19:53.220 --> 19:56.220
Geez, can't he say something more caring?

19:56.220 --> 19:58.160
What's with this "yeah"?

19:58.160 --> 20:00.490
Wait. Look, over here.

20:00.490 --> 20:04.570
Y-You know...

20:04.570 --> 20:05.830
What?

20:05.830 --> 20:08.240
Well, you know...

20:08.240 --> 20:10.570
They're so irritating!

20:10.570 --> 20:13.540
Actually, well...

20:13.540 --> 20:16.010
I-I...

20:16.010 --> 20:18.110
How to say this...

20:18.110 --> 20:22.480
Tell me, Mr. Alien.

20:22.480 --> 20:25.690
I-I'll say this only once, so listen up!

20:25.690 --> 20:28.120
I-I...

20:28.120 --> 20:30.760
I...

20:30.760 --> 20:32.630
You...

20:32.630 --> 20:33.660
L...

20:33.660 --> 20:35.320
Lo...

20:37.430 --> 20:39.430
What?

20:39.430 --> 20:41.670
Okay, that's it! The end!

20:41.670 --> 20:43.330
Back to your posts!

20:46.170 --> 20:47.830
Just great!

20:49.710 --> 20:52.580
Enemy attack! Distance 18,000!

20:52.580 --> 20:57.150
All ships, prepare for battle!
Dread team, standby to launch!

20:57.150 --> 20:59.490
Sorry, a battle's beginning.

20:59.490 --> 21:02.510
Yeah, do your best, dear sister!

21:03.960 --> 21:05.620
S-Sure...

21:10.100 --> 21:11.830
Hey, don't be a slowpoke!

21:11.830 --> 21:14.070
Hurry up and follow me!

21:14.070 --> 21:15.200
Okay!

21:15.200 --> 21:16.270
Let's go!

21:16.270 --> 21:17.930
Combine!

21:20.710 --> 21:23.980
Hey, what's going on out there!

21:23.980 --> 21:27.550
